# Build context for `make test` / `make test-rebuild`. Neither Dockerfile.test
# nor Dockerfile.test-typescript COPYs these in, but excluding them keeps the
# context small enough that a rebuild stays fast on a cold cache.
#
# node_modules and .venv recreate from package-lock.json / requirements.test.txt
# so there is no reason to ship them to the daemon. .pytest_cache / .ruff_cache
# are per-run tooling state.

**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
